    "text": "A bag of sand of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> is suspended by a rope. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> bullet of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> travelling with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ms</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> gets embedded in it, then loss of kinetic energy will be"
