  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>If the final velocity of the bullet and the bag&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>, applying conservation of momentum,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>v</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>v</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Loss in kinetic energy will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
